  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-03",
  "title": "同时走失",
  "storyCode": "6-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "73f6bfcb6b84ce8e9de2239e706fa282bc1ff397689e4f32dcd75513c6fdcf3d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）\n有多少人死在你面前了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "（乌萨斯语）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我会的。我会带回去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "......（乌萨斯语）......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "嗯。我不去切尔诺伯格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "这里很安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "睡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有多少人死在我面前了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "放下武器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......只有你一个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "别回头。再动一下，我就射击！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "弩手要先射击，再说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "什么？身体......消失了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "不......情报档案上有，你是他们的指挥官之一，浮士德。你的法术瞒不住我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我知道，我知道你的法术只对视觉起作用。只要我射击，你也一样会被弩箭刺穿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你能预判我的动作？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我们，两个落单的弩手。同时按下扳机，我们都死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你的名字？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "代号灰喉。你什么时候跳到我身后的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你第三次眨眼的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......你很爽快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你也和你的小队失散了。我不想杀伤没有战意的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我们是敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "罗德岛想要救助感染者。我看到你在帮助感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......那是我的战友。你是我的敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "罗德岛怎么会有这样幼稚的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "是的，我很幼稚。我只会按命令做事。当我自己做决定时，我什么都做不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你要当心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "手指松开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你的弩没有连射机能。只要我躲过你的第一发射击，你就会死。别去按扳机。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "只听从命令，一味依赖别人的想法行动，最后会变成可怕的模样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "多数人只是盲从，他们会退缩，也会颤抖。他们并不真依赖谁，他们只是没有开始思考。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......而那些没有自己方向的人，只是种索求愿望来获得成就感和存在感的机器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "开动，不断运作，投入愿望，实现愿望，把周围一切都吃掉，把许愿的人也吃掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你经历的还不够多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我看见你和刚才那个感染者最后的对话。你在做对的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你的对错和我无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "浮士德，你一直在避开近卫局，哪怕是落单的龙门近卫局，你也没有射击他们。这些我都看到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......别把我的忍耐当成软弱。如果伏击的人是我，你已经死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "但你没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你很累了。只要是用弩的人，都能看出你的疲劳。弦绷得太紧，这样下去一定会断掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......作为弩手，你实在太多话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "你也遭遇了那些特殊感染者，我们可以想办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你说的也许很对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "但我没有办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "（在开始运动的一瞬间消失了？......没法判断他的位置！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "为什么不杀我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你没有射击我，我也没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "下次不会了。如果你没射杀我，我就会射杀你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我没有恶意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "那才最可怜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......也许你需要别人回答你的问题。不回答，你就不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "别有负担，杀人、被杀，这种事天天发生。你们罗德岛也不可能避过的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......为什么不能一起帮助他们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "——我很想答应你的要求，但我知道不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "别再追踪我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你和他们的接触太少了，大脑里满是错觉和误解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......而我已经，没有任何办法了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有多少人因为我做了什么而死，又有多少人因为我什么都没做而死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
